    <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.6;">Ideal for coarse, wavy, curly, coily (2A–4C), color-treated, bleached, or excessively dry hair textures that require deep structural moisture rather than daily surface conditioning.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="zvhc-desc-section" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #2B1B24; margin-bottom: 8px;">Texture &amp; Sensory Ritual</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.6;">A decadent, dense whipped butter-cream with a rich golden-cream hue. Spreads effortlessly from mid-lengths to ends and delights the senses with an uplifting, warm aroma of subtle ginger root and toasted tropical coconut.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="zvhc-desc-section" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #2B1B24; margin-bottom: 8px;">How to Use</h3>
    <ol style="padding-left: 20px; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 0.92rem;">
      <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Cleanse:</strong> Wash hair thoroughly with your favorite sulfate-free shampoo and gently squeeze out excess water.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Apply:</strong> Scoop a generous palm-sized amount (adjust for strand length and density). Work evenly through damp lengths and ends, combing through with fingers or a wide-tooth comb for complete distribution.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Process:</strong> Leave on for <strong>5 to 10 minutes</strong> for express conditioning, or <strong>15 to 20 minutes</strong> with a warm towel or shower cap for an intensive moisture bath.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Rinse:</strong> Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water until water runs completely clear. Style as desired. Use 1–2 times weekly.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="zvhc-desc-section" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #2B1B24; margin-bottom: 8px;">The Zavelyn Batana Routine Pairing</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.6;">For the ultimate restorative hair ritual, pair with <strong>Zavelyn BotanaRoots Pure Batana Scalp &amp; Hair Oil</strong>. Apply 3–5 drops of Batana Oil directly to scalp parted sections 30 minutes before shampooing as a pre-wash treatment, then follow cleansing with this Deep Conditioning Hair Mask to seal lengths and ends.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="zvhc-desc-section" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #2B1B24; margin-bottom: 8px;">Formulation &amp; Ingredients</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Full INCI List:</strong> Aqua (Deionized Water), Cetearyl Alcohol, Steartrimonium Chloride, Elaeis Oleifera (Batana) Kernel Oil, Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Oil, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Camellia Japonica Seed Oil, Zingiber Officinale (Ginger) Root Extract, Biotin, Glycerin, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Dimethiconol, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Aroma (Natural Fragrance).</p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.86rem; color: #8A727E; font-style: italic;">Formulated without sulfates, parabens, phthalates, synthetic dye additives, or mineral oil dilution.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="zvhc-desc-section" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #2B1B24; margin-bottom: 8px;">Safety &amp; Patch Test Guidance</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.6;">For external cosmetic use only. Avoid contact with eyes; if contact occurs, rinse immediately with clean water. We recommend performing a 24-hour patch test on a small area of skin (inner arm) prior to initial use. Discontinue use if irritation occurs. Keep out of reach of children.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="zvhc-desc-section">
    <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #2B1B24; margin-bottom: 8px;">Product Details</h3>
    <ul style="padding-left: 20px; color: #5A4651; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 0.92rem;">
      <li style="margin-bottom: 4px;"><strong>Net Weight:</strong> 120g / 4.23 oz.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 4px;"><strong>Packaging:</strong> Recyclable wide-mouth PET jar with protective tamper-evident inner seal and matte black twist cap, packed in outer protective carton.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 4px;"><strong>Storage:</strong> Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. Keep jar tightly sealed between uses.</li>
